      welcomeIntro: "This app intends to make a universal writing system by applying easy to write and read symbols that are consistent across all languages, allowing you to read a language without ever learning it.",
      welcomeFirstTime: "If this is your first time I would recommend starting in either Play (Core Practice) or Draw, as you'll need to get used to how the words are used. Also note that in the top left you can create a Username (changeable at any time).",
